    <bpmn:process id="W_W4930" name="W4930. PPE Compliance, Usage &amp; DOLE-Compliance Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Periodic audit; DOLE inspection (VS-24/VS-22); incident; compliance dashboard
Frequency: Periodic audit + continuous monitoring
Volume: ~205 sites × PPE-compliance surface × audit cycle
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Internal Audit (VS-21) / Uniform Program Manager
Participants: HSE (VS-24), Internal Audit (VS-21), Site Supervisors (VS-07/VS-04), Compliance (VS-22), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4930 — PPE Compliance, Usage &amp; DOLE-Compliance Audit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4930_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4930_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4930_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4930_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4930_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4930_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4930_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4930_Start3" name="Periodic audit; DOLE inspection (VS-24/VS-22); incident; compliance dashboard">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4930_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4930_Task4" name="Audit PPE compliance: verify role-PPE issued/fit-tested/trained (W4922)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Audit PPE compliance: verify role-PPE issued/fit-tested/trained (W4922), correct use on the floor/yard/DC, PPE in-date/certified (W4925), inspection records current, and DOLE-OSH compliance (links VS-24); document findings
Responsible (R): HSE / Internal Audit / Site Supervisors
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4930_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4930_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4930_Task5" name="Manage DOLE inspection response (links VS-22/VS-24): present PPE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage DOLE inspection response (links VS-22/VS-24): present PPE records/issuance/fit-test/training/inspection evidence, address any finding, and remediate (corrective action) within the DOLE timeline; retain records (VS-88)
Responsible (R): HSE / Compliance / Legal / Program Manager
Accountable (A): HSE Lead / VP Legal
Duration: Per inspection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4930_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4930_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4930_Task6" name="Drive continuous compliance: feed findings to standards/issuance/training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Drive continuous compliance: feed findings to standards/issuance/training improvement, track the compliance KPI (W4913), and escalate repeat/serious non-compliance to disciplinary (VS-84) or supplier (W4931) action
Responsible (R): HSE / Program Manager / HR
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4930_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4930_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4930_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4930_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4930_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-132 (ensure PPE issuance &amp; DOLE compliance.) | - CTL-739: periodic compliance audit; DOLE-remediation within timeline; records current (VS-88); repeat non-compliance escalated (VS-84)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Internal Audit (VS-21) / Uniform Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4930_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4930_Annotation8" targetRef="W4930_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
