    <bpmn:process id="W_W4932" name="W4932. Uniform / PPE Inventory, Stock-Level &amp; Distribution Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Onboarding (W4921); replacement (W4925/W4926); replenishment cycle; distribution
Frequency: Continuous inventory + replenishment
Volume: ~150–250 uniform/PPE SKUs × buffer stock × 205 sites + central/DC holding
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Inventory (VS-05) / DC Ops (VS-04) / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Inventory (VS-05), DC Ops (VS-04), Store Ops (VS-07), Supplier (W4917), Asset Mgmt (VS-35)
Source: workflow W4932 — Uniform / PPE Inventory, Stock-Level &amp; Distribution Management</bpmn:documentation>
