      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4932_Start4" name="Onboarding (W4921); replacement (W4925/W4926); replenishment cycle; distribution">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4932_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4932_Task5" name="Set buffer-stock &amp; replenishment policy: min/max per uniform/PPE SKU per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set buffer-stock &amp; replenishment policy: min/max per uniform/PPE SKU per site/DC, sized to demand (onboarding rate W4921, replacement rate W4925/W4926, lead time W4917), ensuring no day-1-without-uniform or PPE-out-of-stock; balance cost vs availability
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Inventory / Finance
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per policy</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4932_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4932_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4932_Task6" name="Manage inventory &amp; distribution: central holding + DC/site distribution, track…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage inventory &amp; distribution: central holding + DC/site distribution, track stock-levels (VS-05/asset VS-35), replenish from supplier (W4917) on min-trigger, distribute to sites/onboarding, and manage sizing-mix (avoid over-stock of rare sizes)
Responsible (R): Inventory / DC Ops / Store Ops / Supplier
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4932_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4932_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4932_Task7" name="Reconcile &amp; audit: cycle-count uniform/PPE stock, reconcile issued vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile &amp; audit: cycle-count uniform/PPE stock, reconcile issued vs asset-record vs on-hand (VS-35), investigate shrink (theft VS-23), and optimize buffer levels from actual demand/wear-rate
Responsible (R): Inventory / Asset Mgmt / LP / Analytics
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4932_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4932_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4932_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4932_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
