        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-739 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform/PPE Program Analytics, Compliance &amp; Assurance (PA-169.3).) | - CTL-739: buffer-stock policy by demand/lead-time; min/max enforced; cycle-counted; shrink investigated (VS-23)
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / Inventory (VS-05) / DC Ops (VS-04) / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
