      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4934_Task5" name="Design the sustainable-uniform strategy: eco-uniform materials…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the sustainable-uniform strategy: eco-uniform materials (recycled/organic/blended for durability), supplier sustainability (VS-131 ethical + VS-25.2 sustainable sourcing), take-back/recycling of end-of-life uniform, PPE recycling where feasible, and brand-destruction for branded end-of-life (security VS-100.2); align to the ESG program (VS-25)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Program Manager / Procurement / Brand
Accountable (A): Program Manager / Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Per program</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4934_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4934_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4934_Task6" name="Operate take-back &amp; recycling: collect end-of-life uniform/PPE (W4925/W4928)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Operate take-back &amp; recycling: collect end-of-life uniform/PPE (W4925/W4928), brand-destroy/security-shred branded items (avoid misuse VS-100.2/LP VS-23), route recyclable textiles/PPE to recycling partners (links VS-73 circular economy), and track diversion volume
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Facilities / Sustainability / Circular Partner
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4934_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4934_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4934_Task7" name="Measure &amp; report ESG impact: textile-diversion volume, eco-uniform %, supplier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Measure &amp; report ESG impact: textile-diversion volume, eco-uniform %, supplier sustainability score, and include in the ESG report (VS-25.3); drive continuous improvement toward circular/carbon targets
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Analytics / Program Manager
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4934_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4934_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4934_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4934_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
