      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4935_Task4" name="Govern uniform/PPE program data under RA 10173: identify personal data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govern uniform/PPE program data under RA 10173: identify personal data collected (body measurements W4918, PPE-fit/health-linked data, issuance/asset records), classify sensitivity, apply data-minimization/consent/purpose-limitation, and conduct a DPIA where health-linked/sensitive (e.g., respiratory fit-test, disability-adaptive sizing)
Responsible (R): DPO / Program Manager / HR / IT
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per program/change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4935_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4935_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4935_Task5" name="Manage vendor/processor data (VS-91/VS-161): DPA with suppliers/laundry…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage vendor/processor data (VS-91/VS-161): DPA with suppliers/laundry handling sizing/asset data, restrict use to the uniform/PPE purpose, manage sub-processors (VS-161 fourth-party), and ensure secure transfer/storage (VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): DPO / Legal / Procurement / IT
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4935_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4935_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4935_Task6" name="Manage records &amp; retention (VS-88): retain issuance/fit-test/inspection records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage records &amp; retention (VS-88): retain issuance/fit-test/inspection records per DOLE/BIR/policy retention, secure disposal of sizing/health data at end-of-purpose, and supply records for DSAR/privacy requests (VS-91) and audits (W4930)
Responsible (R): DPO / Records / HR / IT
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4935_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4935_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4935_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4935_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4935_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-739 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform/PPE Program Analytics, Compliance &amp; Assurance (PA-169.3).) | - CTL-739: RA 10173-compliant sizing/health data (minimize/consent/DPIA); supplier DPA; retention per policy (VS-88); DSAR-capable
Owner: Privacy/DPO (VS-91) / Uniform Program Manager / HR / Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4935_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4935_Annotation8" targetRef="W4935_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
