    <bpmn:process id="W_W4936" name="W4936. Program Maturity, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; benchmark refresh; maturity assessment (VS-133)
Frequency: Annual + continuous improvement
Volume: 1 group program × annual maturity/benchmark cycle
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / OpEx (VS-133) / HR Strategy
Participants: OpEx (VS-133), HR (VS-19/VS-103), HSE (VS-24), Finance (VS-17.4), Analytics (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4936 — Program Maturity, Benchmarking &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4936_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4936_Lane1" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4936_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4936_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4936_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4936_Lane2" name="OpEx">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4936_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4936_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4936_Start4" name="Annual program review; benchmark refresh; maturity assessment (VS-133)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4936_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4936_Task5" name="Assess program maturity vs benchmark: standards/coverage completeness, PPE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess program maturity vs benchmark: standards/coverage completeness, PPE compliance, cost/employee, CX/satisfaction, sustainability, and tech/cyber maturity; benchmark vs peer retailers and industry norms
Responsible (R): Program Manager / OpEx / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4936_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4936_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4936_Task6" name="Run continuous improvement (VS-133): process-mine the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run continuous improvement (VS-133): process-mine the order→issue→launder→replace→return flow, remove manual handoffs (issuance, sizing, damage/loss, compliance checks), and run an improvement pipeline with benefit realization
Responsible (R): OpEx / Program Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4936_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4936_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4936_Task7" name="Report to leadership &amp; refresh strategy: annual CHRO/CFO/CMO review, reallocate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership &amp; refresh strategy: annual CHRO/CFO/CMO review, reallocate budget based on maturity/benchmark gaps, refresh the multi-year roadmap (W4913), and close the loop with corporate performance (VS-33.2)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / HR Strategy / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4936_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4936_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4936_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4936_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4936_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-739 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform/PPE Program Analytics, Compliance &amp; Assurance (PA-169.3).) | - CTL-739: annual maturity/benchmark review; improvement pipeline with benefit realization; CHRO/CFO reallocation review
Owner: Uniform Program Manager / OpEx (VS-133) / HR Strategy</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
